TITLE: A Study of RC48-ADC Administered Intravenously to Patients With HER2-Positive Metastatic Breast Cancer With or Without Liver Metastases

CONDITIONS: Breast Neoplasms; Breast Diseases; Capecitabine; HER2-positive Breast Cancer; HER2 Positive Breast Carcinoma; HER2-positive Advanced Breast With Liver Metastases

INTERVENTIONS: RC48-ADC; Lapatinib; Capecitabine

